      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Directly, \\(9901\\cdot101=990100\\) \\(+9901=1000001\\) and \\(99\\cdot10101=1010100\\) \\(-10101=999999.\\) Their difference is \\(1000001-999999=2.\\) Thus, the correct answer is A.",
